      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm a bit confused by this canny. I thought you were able to upload a version of the avatar using the same blueprint ID, with one version for Quest and one version for PC, thus the same blueprint ID could be enabled for both (showing the appropriate version to the current user viewing). \n\nThis would mean that you can be both, because your avatar's blueprint ID would exist as both (even if it's not the same appearance  after decimation or retopologization; even though you are not both avatars at the same time for one platform)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
