  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The indicator that appears on the  bottom-right of the name plate is an indicator of the platform the user is currently playing on (either PC or Quest); however, it confusingly uses the same Venn-diagram graphics used to indicate the compatibility of worlds and avatars. I propose that this indicator be changed to use a unique set of graphics, a single blue circle with \"PC\" in it for PC users or a single green circle with a \"Quest\" in it for Quest users. It is impossible for a user to be using both platforms at once, so a Venn-diagram doesn't even make sense in this context.",
